### Reports API Tests — PravahOS
### Requires: login first + regulation with completed MAPs

# -------------------------------------------------------
# 1. GENERATE REPORT
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Generate compliance audit report
GET http://localhost:8000/reports/{{regulation_id}}/report

### Generate report for nonexistent regulation (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/reports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/report
